    "title": "Place an event in time",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-time-reference-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Place an event in time",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Put a time expression before the predicate, either before or after the subject. The verb itself does not change for yesterday, today or tomorrow. An action phrase followed by 前, 后 or 时 means before that event, after it or when it happens. Put the marker after the event phrase, then state the main event. These forms do not by themselves assert that the first event was completed.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "买书前，我学中文。",
                "pinyin": "mǎi shū qián ， wǒ xué Zhōngwén 。",
                "meaning": "Before buying books, I study Chinese.",
                "audio": "53b520d66c45152972ca37bcac141bd122072eba9a7c65124781582fc3d4d020"
              },
              {
                "text": "我买书后学中文。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ mǎi shū hòu xué Zhōngwén 。",
                "meaning": "I study Chinese after buying books.",
                "audio": "f4e3963bb3e681edcaa2c206504e217be2238f7f90c61908a01010f501f635ac"
              },
              {
                "text": "老师说中文时，我说中文。",
                "pinyin": "lǎoshī shuō Zhōngwén shí ， wǒ shuō Zhōngwén 。",
                "meaning": "When the teacher speaks Chinese, I speak Chinese.",
                "audio": "b38d89e8f850c5a23f261fd01af9a913a82b46df001bc6bbe5eda3b620351e2b"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "今天",
                "pinyin": "jīntiān",
                "meaning": "today",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "19cdcccbdcd0a5dd96140148c937d98e141d15ec317e962930413a1ccd18939e"
              },
              {
                "text": "明天",
